WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.690
Catch the dangerous action

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:03.330
before it runs. Every action

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.340
your unattended agent tries is

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.840
intercepted and held here,

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.850
before it runs. Each one is risk

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.680
scored and bound to the exact

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.700
command. One click to allow or

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.950
deny, right in the inbox. Allow

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.210
it and the decision is

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.530
lands in one ledger, chained to

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:20.980
the decision that allowed it.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.910
Outcomes verified, spend and

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:23.740
risk on the

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.020
every rule that governs your

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.250
agents. Govern your agents at

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.460
dashclaw.io.
